      "content": "i know you're trying to be nice but it doesnt feel like that. i see the way they struggle and i know it's because of me. im just a constant source of anxiety and lack in their life. sometimes i sit there thinking that if i wasn't around, they could actually have a chance to breathe. like they could finally just be a kid without worrying about my mess. i feel like a parasite.",
